<title>USA: Fastlane Intl Q2 March 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Fastlane Intl Q2 March 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.05     loss	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net     profit	     454     loss	    30</p>
<p> Revs			   948		    1,205</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,448			868</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 includes $623,280 extraordinary gain on extinguishment of debt. Excluding gain, the company had a net loss of $168,828, or $0.02 a share.</p>
<p>SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.06     loss	 $0.14</p>
