<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 six months includes $623,280 extraordinary gain on extinguishment of debt. Excluding gain, the company had a net loss of $334,118, or $0.06 a share.</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Fastlane International Enterprises Inc.</p>
